B.vU=new A.aQ(B.ch,["More","Share the app","Tell another family about it","We end screen time without tears with One More Cartoon! A cheerful voice counts down the cartoons: 3, 2, 1\u2026 then bath, bed or dinner. {n}","Rate the app","Stars help other parents find it","Send feedback","Ideas or problems? Write to us","One More Cartoon feedback","Cartoons, not minutes","Children see how many cartoons are left: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. A cheerful voice counts them down and warns before the last one.","Set up in seconds","Choose the total time, how long each cartoon is and what comes next: bath, bed, dinner and more.","Made for your family","Add your child\u2019s name. With Siblings mode the voice calls every child, and Who picks tonight takes fair turns.","Skip","Next","Let\u2019s go!"],t.l)
B.Nw=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Altro","Condividi l\u2019app","Consigliala a un\u2019altra famiglia","Con One More Cartoon! finiamo i cartoni senza capricci: una voce allegra conta i cartoni, 3, 2, 1\u2026 poi bagnetto, nanna o pappa. {n}","Valuta l\u2019app","Qualche stella aiuta altri genitori a trovarla","Invia un commento","Idee o problemi? Scrivici","Commento su One More Cartoon","Cartoni, non minuti","Il bambino vede quanti cartoni mancano: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Una voce allegra li conta e avvisa prima dell\u2019ultimo.","Pronto in pochi secondi","Scegli il tempo totale, quanto dura ogni cartone e cosa viene dopo: bagnetto, nanna, pappa e altro.","Su misura per la tua famiglia","Aggiungi il nome del bambino. Con la modalit\xe0 fratelli la voce chiama tutti, e \u201cChi sceglie stasera?\u201d fa i turni giusti.","Salta","Avanti","Iniziamo!"],t.l)
B.Nq=new A.aQ(B.ch,["M\xe1s","Compartir la app","Recomi\xe9ndala a otra familia","Con One More Cartoon! terminamos la tele sin rabietas: una voz alegre cuenta los dibujos, 3, 2, 1\u2026 y luego ba\xf1o, cama o cena. {n}","Valorar la app","Unas estrellas ayudan a otros padres a encontrarla","Enviar comentarios","\xbfIdeas o problemas? Escr\xedbenos","Comentarios sobre One More Cartoon","Dibujos, no minutos","Los ni\xf1os ven cu\xe1ntos dibujos quedan: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Una voz alegre los cuenta y avisa antes del \xfaltimo.","Listo en segundos","Elige el tiempo total, cu\xe1nto dura cada dibujo y lo que viene despu\xe9s: ba\xf1o, cama, cena y m\xe1s.","Hecho para tu familia","A\xf1ade el nombre de tu hijo. Con el modo hermanos la voz llama a todos, y \xab\xbfQui\xe9n elige hoy?\xbb reparte los turnos.","Saltar","Siguiente","\xa1Vamos!"],t.l)
B.Nt=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Plus","Partager l\u2019app","Conseillez-la \xe0 une autre famille","Avec One More Cartoon!, on arr\xeate les dessins anim\xe9s sans larmes : une voix joyeuse compte les \xe9pisodes, 3, 2, 1\u2026 puis bain, dodo ou d\xeener. {n}","Noter l\u2019app","Quelques \xe9toiles aident d\u2019autres parents \xe0 la trouver","Envoyer un avis","Des id\xe9es ou un probl\xe8me ? \xc9crivez-nous","Avis sur One More Cartoon","Des dessins anim\xe9s, pas des minutes","L\u2019enfant voit combien de dessins anim\xe9s il reste : 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Une voix joyeuse les compte et pr\xe9vient avant le dernier.","Pr\xeat en quelques secondes","Choisissez la dur\xe9e totale, la dur\xe9e de chaque dessin anim\xe9 et la suite : bain, dodo, d\xeener et plus.","Fait pour votre famille","Ajoutez le pr\xe9nom de votre enfant. Avec le mode fratrie, la voix appelle chacun, et \xab Qui choisit ce soir ? \xbb fait des tours \xe9quitables.","Passer","Suivant","C\u2019est parti !"],t.l)
B.Nx=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Mehr","App teilen","Empfiehl sie einer anderen Familie","Mit One More Cartoon! endet die Bildschirmzeit ohne Tr\xe4nen: Eine fr\xf6hliche Stimme z\xe4hlt die Folgen, 3, 2, 1\u2026 dann Baden, Bett oder Essen. {n}","App bewerten","Ein paar Sterne helfen anderen Eltern, sie zu finden","Feedback senden","Ideen oder Probleme? Schreib uns","Feedback zu One More Cartoon","Folgen statt Minuten","Kinder sehen, wie viele Folgen noch \xfcbrig sind: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Eine fr\xf6hliche Stimme z\xe4hlt mit und warnt vor der letzten.","In Sekunden eingestellt","W\xe4hle die Gesamtzeit, wie lang eine Folge dauert und was danach kommt: Baden, Bett, Essen und mehr.","F\xfcr deine Familie gemacht","F\xfcge den Namen deines Kindes hinzu. Im Geschwister-Modus ruft die Stimme alle Kinder, und \u201eWer w\xe4hlt heute?\u201c wechselt fair ab.","\xdcberspringen","Weiter","Los geht\u2019s!"],t.l)
B.Ny=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Mais","Compartilhar o app","Indique para outra fam\xedlia","Com o One More Cartoon! a hora da TV acaba sem birra: uma voz alegre conta os desenhos, 3, 2, 1\u2026 e depois banho, cama ou jantar. {n}","Avaliar o app","Algumas estrelas ajudam outros pais a encontr\xe1-lo","Enviar coment\xe1rio","Ideias ou problemas? Escreva para n\xf3s","Coment\xe1rio sobre o One More Cartoon","Desenhos, n\xe3o minutos","A crian\xe7a v\xea quantos desenhos faltam: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Uma voz alegre conta e avisa antes do \xfaltimo.","Pronto em segundos","Escolha o tempo total, quanto dura cada desenho e o que vem depois: banho, cama, jantar e mais.","Feito para a sua fam\xedlia","Adicione o nome da crian\xe7a. No modo irm\xe3os a voz chama todos, e \u201cQuem escolhe hoje?\u201d reveza de forma justa.","Pular","Pr\xf3ximo","Vamos l\xe1!"],t.l)
B.Nu=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Meer","App delen","Raad hem aan bij een ander gezin","Met One More Cartoon! stopt de schermtijd zonder tranen: een vrolijke stem telt de tekenfilms af, 3, 2, 1\u2026 en dan badje, bed of eten. {n}","App beoordelen","Een paar sterren helpen andere ouders hem te vinden","Feedback sturen","Idee\xebn of problemen? Schrijf ons","Feedback over One More Cartoon","Tekenfilms, geen minuten","Kinderen zien hoeveel tekenfilms er nog zijn: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Een vrolijke stem telt af en waarschuwt voor de laatste.","In een paar seconden klaar","Kies de totale tijd, hoe lang een tekenfilm duurt en wat er daarna komt: badje, bed, eten en meer.","Gemaakt voor jouw gezin","Voeg de naam van je kind toe. In de broer-en-zus-modus roept de stem iedereen, en \u201eWie kiest er vanavond?\u201d wisselt eerlijk af.","Overslaan","Volgende","Aan de slag!"],t.l)
B.Nv=new A.aQ(B.ch,["Wi\u0119cej","Udost\u0119pnij aplikacj\u0119","Pole\u0107 j\u0105 innej rodzinie","Z One More Cartoon! ko\u0144czymy bajki bez p\u0142aczu: weso\u0142y g\u0142os odlicza bajki, 3, 2, 1\u2026 a potem k\u0105piel, spanie albo kolacja. {n}","Oce\u0144 aplikacj\u0119","Kilka gwiazdek pomaga innym rodzicom j\u0105 znale\u017a\u0107","Wy\u015blij opini\u0119","Pomys\u0142y lub problemy? Napisz do nas","Opinia o One More Cartoon","Bajki, nie minuty","Dziecko widzi, ile bajek zosta\u0142o: 3\u2026 2\u2026 1. Weso\u0142y g\u0142os je odlicza i ostrzega przed ostatni\u0105.","Gotowe w kilka sekund","Wybierz \u0142\u0105czny czas, d\u0142ugo\u015b\u0107 jednej bajki i co b\u0119dzie potem: k\u0105piel, spanie, kolacja i wi\u0119cej.","Dla Twojej rodziny","Dodaj imi\u0119 dziecka. W trybie rodze\u0144stwa g\u0142os wo\u0142a wszystkich, a \u201eKto dzi\u015b wybiera?\u201d sprawiedliwie zmienia kolejk\u0119.","Pomi\u0144","Dalej","Zaczynamy!"],t.l)
